            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pinkypink"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great idea! I'm drinking this as a pre-drink. Great for a long party night. I used fresh strawberries instead of frozen. I think this one would work with almost any fruit. I may try this one with added vodka sometime too.",
            "datePublished": "2008-03-07T18:49:23.627Z"
          },
          {
