            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cathy J"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is delicious because Red Bull is delicious. I added the recommended amount of strawberries and it still tasted like a slushy Red Bull. I added more strawberries, same result. Like I said, it was yummy, but I’m giving it 3 stars because I was expecting more of a strawberry punch and it just didn’t happy. I feel the Red Bull is too overpowering for strawberries, in any ratio.",
            "datePublished": "2020-11-03T15:24:26.607Z"
          },
